    "badge": "",
    "description": "Departure from Nalchik at 09:00 in the morning from city center.\r\n\r\nOur company \"KavkazSkiTur\" offers you amazing horse rides!\r\n\r\n \tDo you dream of riding horses, but are afraid and don't know where to start?\r\n \tDo you want to but don't know how to ride?\r\n \tAre you tired of stress and daily routine?\r\n \tDo you need new positive emotions?\r\n\r\nThen horseback riding is what you need! This is a great opportunity to get away from the hustle and bustle of the city and spend the whole day alone with nature. A day full of vivid impressions and positive emotions with kind and gentle horses! This walk will give you an unforgettable delight! Anyone who has ridden at least once can attest to this. And what could be better than a horse ride in the picturesque mountains of Karachay-Cherkessia? A leisurely trip to the waterfalls Honey Falls on horseback will give you a lot of memorable experiences!\r\n\r\nIn addition, our photographer will go with you, who will be happy to capture the brightest moments of the walk. As a memento of this trip, you will have memorable photos!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[timeline]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"Ring-Mountain\"]\r\nRing-Mountain is a completely unusual, wonderful formation in the rock. It is located on the outskirts of the city of Kislovodsk. From this mountain you will see gorgeous views of the picturesque grottoes and mysterious caves, and in the distance you will see the Main Caucasian Range. If the weather is good, you will be able to admire the snow-white tops of Elbrus.\r\n\r\nHere we will spend about 20 minutes and go to the horse base.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"6670,6671,6674\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"2\" title=\"Horse base location\"]\r\n\r\nHere we will be given a short mandatory briefing on the rules and features of horseback riding. The most important rule to remember and follow is to show respect for your horse.\r\n\r\nAfter riding horses, we guarantee you a surge of strength, vivacity, good mood, improvement of psychological and physical well-being.\r\n\r\nIn addition, here you can issue a gift certificate for a horseback ride and give it to a loved one! Is it not possible to find a more romantic and unexpected gift that can leave anyone indifferent!\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"2550,2526,2530,2548,2520,2531\"]\r\n\r\nHorse riding time - 1 hour.\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"3\" title=\"Zipline\"]\r\nZipline will give an incredible surge of adrenaline and positive emotions! We invite you to fly over the abyss on the longest zipline in Rus",
