    "badge": "",
    "description": "﻿\r\n\r\nMount Ullu Tau is an incredibly picturesque and mysterious place located at the foot of Elbrus, the locals call it the Valley of Angels.\r\n\r\nUlla-Tau - is part of the Caucasus Range, the border between Russia and Georgia passes along its crest. Not only the mountain itself is interesting, but also many gorges, beautiful mountain rivers, waterfalls, incredibly beautiful lakes on the way to it. The mountain closes the Adyr-Su gorge, which can be reached through the Doktorsky pass on an off-road vehicle using a lift, and for tourists via a metal stairs.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3488,3489,3487,3495,3472,3486\"]\r\n\r\nClimbing the Ulla-Tau peak, to a height of more than 4000 meters above sea level, attracts climbers, outdoor enthusiasts, and pilgrims here. From here you can see Elbrus and other Caucasian mountains. Here you can enjoy the beauty of the nature of the Caucasus and ask the mountain for the fulfillment of desires.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3501,3499,3500\"]\r\n\r\nThe legend of how the mountain grants wishes is passed down from generation to generation. The second name of this mountain is \"Mother Mountain\". It is believed that its top is a bridge for communication with God. People believe that any wish voiced here will surely come true within a year. Ullu Tau fulfills only the most cherished, the main human desires - about motherhood, health, happiness. Women who dream of children experience the joy of motherhood, single women find a couple, desperate people dramatically change their fate, having been nourished by the great power and energy of this place. Every year, tourists and pilgrims from all over the world turn to the mountain, because dreams come true here!\r\n\r\nFresh mountain air, impregnable rocks, snowy peaks, mineral water springs - all this will leave an indelible impression on a trip to this magical mountain, give peace, harmony and peace of mind.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\nTour program\n\n\r\n[timeline]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"Baksan Gorge\"]Transfer by SUV to Baksan Gorge;[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"2\" title=\"Verkhny Baksan\"]Moving to the village. Upper Baksan;[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"3\" title=\"Doctor's Pass\"]Doctor's Pass, rest;[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"4\" title=\"Adyr-Su Gorge\"]Climbing the stairs and lift to the Adyr-Su Gorge;[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"5\" title=\"UlluTau\"]Transfer to the alp-camp \"UlluTau\";\r\nTea on the fire, treats, commemorative photos.[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item ",
