    "description": "﻿\r\n\r\nKanzhol Plateau is a breathtaking place overlooking the great Elbrus. This is the highest plateau in Kabardino-Balkaria, located almost 3000 meters above sea level. A whole ancient country with a long history, settlements dissolved in time, unexplored burials, vast expanses of meadows. It offers magnificent panoramas. Picturesque rocks with columns, peaks of the Caucasus Mountains, breathtaking views and paintings. The plateau is located 10 km from Elbrus in a straight line, so it is easy to see the two-headed giant from here.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3621,3625,3624,3628,3620,3599\"]\r\n\r\nOur excursion route will pass through Tyzyl Gorge, the slopes of which are strewn with alpine meadows, bright flowers, waterfalls. This is a corner of wildlife practically untouched by man. Then through an abandoned village, shrouded in secrets and legends, to the largest and majestic plateau of Kabardino-Balkaria.\r\n\r\nWe will visit the ancient cave, which consists of two halls. Between the halls is an icy waterfall. In the second hall there is a well, into which you can go down and see at its bottom a skull the size of a bear's head. The history of the origin of this skull is still not known, many hypotheses have been put forward, perhaps these are the remains of ancient people. This is evidenced by the many burial grounds in the gorge. Burial caves are small and low, located close to each other, one above the other.\r\n\r\nPicturesque pictures of the gorge, hidden waterfalls and the majestic mountains of the Caucasus will remain in memory for a long time.\r\nTour program\n\n\r\n[timeline]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"Valley of the Tyzyl River\"]The Tyzyl Gorge is one of the most beautiful places in Kabardino-Balkaria, it begins right behind the village of Kendelen. The path will pass through a narrow gorge under overhanging cliffs, which are decorated with forests and magical waterfalls. Inexpressible delight!\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3632,3584,3585,3586,3587,3588\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"2\" title=\"Hidden Waterfalls\"]Next, the gorge itself awaits us, where we will visit several beautiful and completely hidden waterfalls!\r\nOn the territory of the gorge there is a magnificent waterfall, a stream of water rushing down, scattering into thousands of streams and millions of droplets, a continuous curtain of water. When the sun shines on the waterfall, the effect of what you see is simply mesmerizing. And there are many such amazing places in the gorge, this part of ",
