    "badge": "",
    "description": "You won't regret your decision to go to Bermamyt Plateau! From here you can see the amazing beauty of the Caucasus Mountains and a gorgeous view of the two-headed Elbrus. It's just a miracle of nature!\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3692,3735,3733,3725,3724,3722\"]\r\n\r\nTwo magnificent stone massifs at the foot of the great Elbrus! A very romantic and powerful place in its energy! On the plateau you can see the Broken Ghost (these are circles on clouds and silhouettes of people formed as a result of refraction of light) and St. Elmo's Fire (the natural glow of stones due to the lightning discharges contained in them). You won't see this anywhere else. Everything here is unique, mysterious, incredibly beautiful. Indelible impressions will stay with you for a long time.\r\n\r\nSunsets and sunrises of amazing beauty, majestic cliffs, giant mountains, deep cliffs, picturesque cliffs, bright slopes covered with alpine flowers and greenery - all this fascinates tourists, inspires artists to create creative masterpieces, attracts many travelers to this cradle of true beauty.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3721,3715,3720\"]\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3712,3713,3714\"]\r\nTour program\n\n\r\n[timeline]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"Bermamyt Plateau\"]The main goal of our tour is to admire the Bermamyt plateau, the quirkiness of its relief, the asymmetry of its slopes, carved canyons, and an incredible view of Elbrus. Here you can enjoy peace, tranquility and incredible nature.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3706,3707,3708\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"2\" title=\"Amphitheater\"]The Bermamyt Amphitheater is a kind of unique arc-shaped depression of a cliff. From the side, it really resembles an ancient theater with a sharp ledge in the middle, like a small stage. One of the favorite places for tourists to take pictures.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3703,3700,3697,3699,3702,3695\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"3\" title=\"Two Monk Rocks\"]Two unique rocks that look like silhouettes of hooded people from the side. Only professional climbers with special equipment can climb them. Therefore, we will admire them from the side and take a lot of memorable pictures.[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"4\" title=\"Panoramic platform with a view of Elbrus\"]According to many reviews from tourists, this is where the best view of Elbrus opens. Gorgeous panorama of the snowy peaks of the giant and complete unity with nature are provided.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3705,3689,3716\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item it",
