    "title": "Highland area Digoria",
    "category": "jeep-tours",
    "categoryLabel": "Off-Road 4x4 Jeep Tours",
    "durationDays": 2,
    "duration": "1-2 days",
    "altitudeMeters": 2200,
    "altitude": "2,200 m",
    "priceRub": 3500,
    "priceUsd": 38,
    "difficulty": "Moderate",
    "season": "May — October 2026",
    "image": "/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/IMG_1003.jpg",
    "coverImage": "/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/IMG_1003.jpg",
    "gallery": [
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/b892890600.jpg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-1.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-2.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-3.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-4.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-5.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-6.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-7.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765366-8.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765379.jpeg",
      "/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/photo1635765379-1.jpeg"
    ],
    "badge": "",
    "description": "Digorsky Gorge is a land of pristine nature and ancient architecture, a gathering point for climbers and one of the most beautiful places in all of North Ossetia. We will visit the lakes and weterfalls, see the ancestral towers, fortresses and sanctuaries of the Digorians.\r\n\r\nDigoria is a magical land of untouched beauty and natural splendor. This is the most beautiful corner of the Caucasus, where its chamomile soul peeps through the silver strings of transparent waterfalls and cold bulks of gray-haired glaciers. There is everything here to amuse the imagination, please the spirit and strengthen the body: high mountain peaks, wide valleys, deep caves, icy rivers and life-giving springs.\r\nTour program\n\n\r\n[timeline]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"Glade Porog Neba (sky threshold)\"] The Threshold of Heaven complex is located in one of the most picturesque corners of North Ossetia - Alania, on a huge plateau hidden from the outside world by mountains. They carefully surrounded the valley, named the Sunny place.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3833,3826,3812,3816,3818,3824\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"2\" title=\"Waterfall Three sisters\"] The heart of Digoria is the Taimazi massif with age-old glaciers and crystal waterfalls falling from them. They are usually referred to as the \"Three Sisters\". They are very colorful!\r\n\r\nThree powerful water streams are very impressive both from afar and near, striking tourists with their grandeur. The waterfalls are located close to each other, literally 200 meters separate them. They originate from the Taimazi glacier and flow into the Tanadon River. The power of the streams has carved a winding path in the stones over the years and created many recesses and ledges.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3817,3821,3832,3836,3815,3827\"]\r\n\r\nThe middle waterfall is the most powerful and beautiful. It is near it that all the strength and power of the elements are felt. Nearby is a small cave, which offers a magnificent panoramic view. The waterfalls are majestic and beautiful. In cloudy weather, when the tops of the mountains are not visible, it seems that the water is falling directly from the sky. On a sunny day, the landscape is especially beautiful due to the surrounding forest and vegetation.\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"3\" title=\"Fasnal Village\"]\r\n\r\nNext, we will walk through the village of Fasnal and see the ruins of the Belgian factory.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3850,3846,3848\"]\r\n\r\nThe village looks no different from o",
