    "description": "Excursion and jeep tour in Kabardino-Balkaria for groups of 4 pax and more.\r\n\r\nShort description of the tour :\r\n\r\nDay 1 | Meeting at the airport (railway station) Nalchik / Minvody,\r\ntransfer to the hotel in city Nalchik. Accommodation and departure for a sightseeing tour of the city.\r\n\r\nDay 2 | Breakfast at the hotel and departure for a jeep tour to the Kanzhal plateau.\r\nReturn to the hotel, free time.\r\n\r\nDay 3 | Breakfast at the hotel and departure for a jeep tour to Djili -Su. Return to the hotel, free time.\r\n\r\nDay 4 | Breakfast at the hotel and departure for a jeep tour of the Chegem Gorge.\r\nReturn to the hotel, free time.\r\n\r\nDay 5 | Transfer to the airport (railway station) Nalchik / Minvody.\r\n\r\nTour price includes:\r\n[icon_tick state=\"on\"] hotel accommodation 3* (double/twin occupancy, standard rooms)\r\n[icon_tick state=\"on\"] breakfasts at the hotel\r\n[icon_tick state=\"on\"] program services off road trips;\r\n[icon_tick state=\"on\"] transfers (to/from airport).\r\n\r\nAdditional costs:\r\n[icon_tick state=\"off\"] souvenirs, personal expenses, meals.\r\n\r\nDetailed itinerary :\r\n\r\n[timeline][timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"DAY 1\"]Resort Nalchik\r\n\r\nMeet and transfer. Arrival of the group at the airport / railway Minvody or Nalchik\r\nmeeting with a sign \"KavkazSkiTur\"\r\n2:00 pm | Hotel accommodation\r\n2:30 pm | Sightseeing tour of Nalchik with a visit of cable-ways\r\n\r\nNalchik is a resort city, the capital and heart of Kabardino-Balkaria. Surrounded by a horseshoe of mountains. Everyone knows that the horseshoe symbolizes happiness, which is why the inhabitants call it the City of Happiness! The list of sights of the city is huge. These are natural objects, and parks, and monuments, and museums. The measured life and cozy, calm atmosphere of the city make guests fall in love with it. Walks along the famous Shogentsukov and Lenin Avenues, from which the stunning landscapes of the Caucasus Mountains are visible, will win the heart of any tourist!\r\n\r\nThe sightseeing tour of the city includes: climbing Mount Malaya Kizilovka, walking along the Atazhukinsky garden, walking along the Arbat, visiting the monuments located in the city center, visiting the Cathedral Mosque and the Orthodox Church of St. Simeon the Stylite and the Church of Mary Magdalene.\r\n\r\n[gallery ids=\"3232,3214,3217,3206,3196,3184\"]\r\n\r\n18:00 | Return to the hotel in Nalchik\r\n19:00 | Dinner provided at the hotel\r\n\r\n[icon_tick state=\"off\"]Additional costs: tickets to the lifts - 300 rubles per person; lunch -",
