    "description": "Tour Program\r\n[timeline]\r\n\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"1\" title=\"\"]\r\nDay 1: Arrival Day\r\nWe meet our tourists at the airports or at the railway stations of Mineralnye Vody or Nalchik, we provide a transfer to the hotel. Next, we introduce the guide and equipment checking and rental.\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"2\" title=\"\"]\r\nDay 2: station Azau-st.Krugozor\r\nWe are going for a snowshoe climb from the Azau glade to the Krugozor station along the ski slope. After 1 hour from the start of the journey, we will make a stop at the hut to rest. We still have 1.5-2 hours of climbing ahead of us. At the Krugozor station, we rest in a cafe, we can have a bite to eat and recuperate. We go down at your discretion - on foot or by cable car (extra cost).\r\n\r\n[gallery columns=\"4\" ids=\"4540,4538,4539,4526\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"3\" title=\"\"]\r\nDay 3: st.Azau-st.Mir\r\nOn the third day, we will climb the cable car from the Azau station to Krugozor, and then we will go on foot. We are going for a fascinating 2-3 hour walk to Mir station. At the station, we will rest in a cafe, recuperate and go down to the Mir station by cable car.\r\n\r\n[gallery columns=\"4\" ids=\"4545,4546,4542,4544\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"4\" title=\"\"]\r\nDay 4: alp center Shkhelda-glacier Shkhelda\r\nToday we will go by car from our hotel to the Adyl-su gorge, get to the border post and then go on foot to the Shkhelda camp. Within 30 minutes we will walk along the path to the first avalanche cone, then for an hour on snowshoes we will climb to the sites. Here we organize rest and a small snack. Ahead of us is the crossing of the river and access to the incredibly beautiful Shkheldinsky glacier. We will walk along the majestic glacier for 1.5-2 hours to the fork of the gorge. The way back will be the same as the ascent.\r\n\r\n[gallery columns=\"4\" ids=\"4557,4555,4552,4556,4554,4532,4567,4527\"]\r\n\r\n[/timeline_item]\r\n\r\n[timeline_item item_number=\"5\" title=\" \"]\r\nDay 5: alp camp Jantugan - glade Green Hotel\r\nToday we have to go along the bed of the Adylsu river from the camp Dzhantugan to the moraine. Along the river we will go to the bridge over the river. Then we will pass through a wide valley and arrive at the Green Hotel. The route will take approximately 2 hours. Here we will rest. Ahead is another 1 hour of travel past the houses of glaciologists to the Dzhankuat glacier. Here we will organize another halt for rest and begin to descend back.",
